  "body_text": "基本信息\n国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n产区：南部部族州-盖迪奥-盖德比 Gedeb, Gedeo, SNNPR\n庄园/处理厂：碧罗雅 Beloya\n品种：原生种 Heirloom （Kumie, Diga, Wilsho）\n海拔：1700 - 2000 米\n处理方式：\n水洗 Washed (湿发酵36-48小时）\n采收处理：2022/12 - 2023/1\n海运到港：2023/4\n‍\n‍\n‍\n‍\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：柑橘、茉莉绿茶感、蔗糖甜\nCitrus, Jasmine tea-like, Cane sugar sweet\n关于 Beloya\nBeloya 处理站位于埃塞南部部族洲耶加雪菲镇南边接壤的科契尔小区域，因为所产的咖啡具有耶加雪菲的典型风味特征，所以也被以耶加雪菲命名（埃塞ECX最新的咖啡合同定义里已经将Kochere合并入耶加雪菲大类下，以后Beloya就名正言顺的可以叫耶加雪菲Beloya了）。\nBeloya是一个比较小的合作社，服务周边500多户小农。\nBeloya现在隶属于埃塞的咖啡贸易公司Tracon，目前Beloya有近200张晒床，每一产季处理鲜果约500吨。\n公众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content defaultNoSetting\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TKk4Z6v7KqlnOH1icOoxkR0hXBMW5bsKGPXQBFfQWyRLYpcd1sdHSak82GoL8Spsn6ia53X6dWsRVA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           基本信息\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.0980392);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          国家：埃塞俄比亚 Ethiopia\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          产区：南部部族州-盖迪奥-盖德比 Gedeb, Gedeo, SNNPR\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园/处理厂：碧罗雅 Beloya\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：原生种 Heirloom （Kumie, Diga, Wilsho）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海拔：1700 - 2000 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          水洗 Washed (湿发酵36-48小时）\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采收处理：2022/12 - 2023/1\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          海运到港：2023/4\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：柑橘、茉莉绿茶感、蔗糖甜\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Citrus, Jasmine tea-like, Cane sugar sweet\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QCcTqPiaCB9OxiaaqAtrvrJAibq6RgZONK8Hdg7ntuMtEsJjribBkX065gEG4Wd4NWLQlBXM2w6LtV7Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 415px;height: 661px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 Beloya\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Beloya 处理站位于埃塞南部部族洲耶加雪菲镇南边接壤的科契尔小区域，因为所产的咖啡具有耶加雪菲的典型风味特征，所以也被以耶加雪菲命名（埃塞ECX最新的咖啡合同定义里已经将Kochere合并入耶加雪菲大类下，以后Beloya就名正言顺的可以叫耶加雪菲Beloya了）。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SHZLbYlQS1nLtCjecjqTelvSujDKlJzYqQoom0FtPFnOpuCBgDNgf7KibA2OGI4EzqDk1OiaCL41Jg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Beloya是一个比较小的合作社，服务周边500多户小农。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TKk4Z6v7KqlnOH1icOoxkR07u2cBuSTwJyJ5yjXFETofpn3L5bXjVuytgoekicib5FX4tf2CY8j5REg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Beloya现在隶属于埃塞的咖啡贸易公司Tracon，目前Beloya有近200张晒床，每一产季处理鲜果约500吨。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"height: 165px;width: 388px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
